  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Drift plots\nRun each cell independently. `goodSpecs` must exist (run the fit cell above first).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* DCT spectrum — g(k) for E1 only, sorted by file number (= time order) *)\ne1Specs = SortBy[\n  Select[goodSpecs, FileNameTake[#[\"File\"], {-2}] === \"E1\" &],\n  Last[ToExpression /@ StringCases[FileNameTake[#[\"File\"]], NumberString], 0] &\n];\nDCTPlots`PlotGK[e1Specs]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"289054\" data-output-id=\"272\" data-out-n=\"1400\" data-sub-idx=\"2\" data-output-format=\"Auto\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"24\" data-sub-start=\"5\" data-sub-end=\"5\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1400]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\Bob Lansdorp\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_avuz8g31dgee.svg\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_avuz8g31dgee.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* DCT spectrum — g(k) for E1 only, sorted by file number (= time order) *)\ne1Specs = SortBy[\n  Select[goodSpecs, FileNameTake[#[\"File\"], {-2}] === \"E1\" &],\n  Last[ToExpression /@ StringCases[FileNameTake[#[\"File\"]], NumberString], 0] &\n];\nDCTPlots`PlotGK[e1Specs]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "e5e46f4a-bc82-4edc-b51e-49fd194b45a8"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Cumulative capacitance vs k *)\nDCTPlots`PlotCumulative[goodSpecs]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"289054\" data-output-id=\"273\" data-out-n=\"1401\" data-sub-idx=\"1\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"25\" data-sub-start=\"1\" data-sub-end=\"1\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1401]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\Bob Lansdorp\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_15ukdritg0chw.svg\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_15ukdritg0chw.svg\"/></div></div>",
