  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### Biophysical model fits\n\n**Model A** (no non-folding fraction): assumes all aptamers can fold — ff saturates at 1.  \n**Model B** (with non-folding fraction α): fraction α never folds regardless of ligand — ff saturates at f₀ + (1−α)(1−f₀).  \nBoth share the same baseline f₀ fixed from the 0 µM data.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Biophysical model fits — overlay on fraction folded data\n   Model A (no NF): ff(c) = f0 + (1-f0) / (1 + 10^(logKD - log10 c))   [all aptamers fold]\n   Model B (with NF): ff(c) = f0 + (1-NF)(1-f0) / (1 + 10^(logKD - log10 c))  [fraction NF never folds] *)\n\n(* baseline from 0 µM measurements — index 1 in ffPerElectrode is 0 µM *)\nf0 = Mean[ffPerElectrode[[All, 1, 2]]];\n\n(* all {log10(c), ff} points across all electrodes, positive concentrations only *)\nconcGrid = ffPerElectrode[[1, All, 1]];\nposIdx   = Select[Range[Length[concGrid]], concGrid[[#]] > 0 &];\nallLogPts = Flatten[\n  Map[{Log10[#[[1]]], #[[2]]} &, ffPerElectrode[[All, posIdx]], {2}],\n  1];\n\n(* Model A: only KD free — assumes all aptamers fold, ff → 1 at saturation *)\nfitA = NonlinearModelFit[allLogPts,\n  f0 + (1. - f0) / (1. + 10.^(logKdA - lx)),\n  {{logKdA, 2.9}}, lx];\nkdA = 10.^(logKdA /. fitA[\"BestFitParameters\"]);\n\n(* Model B: KD and non-folding fraction NF both free; NF bounded to (0,1) *)\nfitB = NonlinearModelFit[allLogPts,\n  f0 + (1. - nfB) * (1. - f0) / (1. + 10.^(logKdB - lx)),\n  {{logKdB, 2.}, {nfB, 0.4, 0., 0.99}}, lx];\nlogKdBval = logKdB /. fitB[\"BestFitParameters\"];\nnfBval    = nfB    /. fitB[\"BestFitParameters\"];\nkdB = 10.^logKdBval;\n\ndarkBg  = GrayLevel[0.12];\nfgStyle = Directive[White, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]];\neCols   = Directive[ColorData[97][#], AbsoluteThickness[1.8], Opacity[0.65]] & /@ {1,2,3};\n\nShow[\n  ListLinePlot[ffPerElectrode[[All, posIdx]],\n    ScalingFunctions -> {\"Log10\", None},\n    Joined -> True, PlotMarkers -> {Automatic, 8}, PlotStyle -> eCols,\n    Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> darkBg, FrameStyle -> fgStyle,\n    LabelStyle -> Directive[White, 14, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n    FrameLabel -> {Style[\"[Ligand] (\\[Mu]M)\", 14, White],\n                   Style[\"Fraction folded\", 14, White]},\n    PlotRange -> {{0.8, 1200}, {0, 1}},\n    PlotRangePadding -> Scaled[0.04],\n    ImageSize -> 540, AspectRatio -> 0.75,\n    PlotLegends -> Placed[LineLegend[eCols, {\"E1\",\"E2\",\"E3\"},\n      LabelStyle -> Directive[White,12], Background -> darkBg,\n      LegendFunction -> (Framed[#, Background->darkBg,\n                           FrameStyle->fgStyle]&)], Right]\n  ],\n  (* Model A: dashed gray — no non-folding fraction *)\n  Plot[f0 + (1-f0)/(1 + 10^(Log10[kdA] - Log10[cx])), {cx, 0.8, 1200},\n    ScalingFunctions -> {\"Log10\", None},\n    PlotStyle -> Directive[GrayLevel[0.65], Dashed, AbsoluteThickness[2.]],\n    Axes -> False],\n  (* Model B: solid white — with non-folding fraction *)\n  Plot[f0 + (1-nfBval)*(1-f0)/(1 + 10^(Log10[kdB] - Log10[cx])), {cx, 0.8, 1200},\n    ScalingFunctions -> {\"Log10\", None},\n    PlotStyle -> Directive[White, AbsoluteThickness[2.]],\n    Axes -> False],\n  Epilog -> {\n    (* \"no NF\" label — top right *)\n    Text[Style[Row[{\"no NF:  K\", Subscript[\"D\",\"\"], \" = \",\n      NumberForm[Round[kdA, 1.], {6,1}], \" \\[Mu]M\"}],\n      GrayLevel[0.65], 12, FontFamily->\"Arial\"], Scaled[{0.8, 0.80}]],\n    (* \"NF = ...\" label — middle, just above the plateau *)\n    Text[Style[Row[{\"NF = \", NumberForm[nfBval, {3,2}], \":  K\",\n      Subscript[\"D\",\"\"], \" = \",\n      NumberForm[Round[kdB, 1.], {6,1}], \" \\[Mu]M\"}],\n      White, 12, FontFamily->\"Arial\"], Scaled[{0.42, 0.43}]]\n  }\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"289054\" data-output-id=\"283\" data-out-n=\"1438\" data-sub-idx=\"18\" data-output-format=\"Auto\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"39\" data-sub-start=\"32\" data-sub-end=\"69\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1438]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\Bob Lansdorp\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_1el35nyc4owie.svg\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_1el35nyc4owie.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* Biophysical model fits — overlay on fraction folded data\n   Model A (no NF): ff(c) = f0 + (1-f0) / (1 + 10^(logKD - log10 c))   [all aptamers fold]\n   Model B (with NF): ff(c) = f0 + (1-NF)(1-f0) / (1 + 10^(logKD - log10 c))  [fraction NF never folds] *)\n\n(* baseline from 0 µM measurements — index 1 in ffPerElectrode is 0 µM *)\nf0 = Mean[ffPerElectrode[[All, 1, 2]]];\n\n(* all {log10(c), ff} points across all electrodes, positive concentrations only *)\nconcGrid = ffPerElectrode[[1, All, 1]];\nposIdx   = Select[Range[Length[concGrid]], concGrid[[#]] > 0 &];\nallLogPts = Flatten[\n  Map[{Log10[#[[1]]], #[[2]]} &, ffPerElectrode[[All, posIdx]], {2}],\n  1];\n\n(* Model A: only KD free — assumes all aptamers fold, ff → 1 at saturation *)\nfitA = NonlinearModelFit[allLogPts,\n  f0 + (1. - f0) / (1. + 10.^(logKdA - lx)),\n  {{logKdA, 2.9}}, lx];\nkdA = 10.^(logKdA /. fitA[\"BestFitParameters\"]);\n\n(* Model B: KD and non-folding fraction NF both free; NF bounded to (0,1) *)\nfitB = NonlinearModelFit[allLogPts,\n  f0 + (1. - nfB) * (1. - f0) / (1. + 10.^(logKdB - lx)),\n  {{logKdB, 2.}, {nfB, 0.4, 0., 0.99}}, lx];\nlogKdBval = logKdB /. fitB[\"BestFitParameters\"];\nnfBval    = nfB    /. fitB[\"BestFitParameters\"];\nkdB = 10.^logKdBval;\n\ndarkBg  = GrayLevel[0.12];\nfgStyle = Directive[White, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]];\neCols   = Directive[ColorData[97][#], AbsoluteThickness[1.8], Opacity[0.65]] & /@ {1,2,3};\n\nShow[\n  ListLinePlot[ffPerElectrode[[All, posIdx]],\n    ScalingFunctions -> {\"Log10\", None},\n    Joined -> True, PlotMarkers -> {Automatic, 8}, PlotStyle -> eCols,\n    Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> darkBg, FrameStyle -> fgStyle,\n    LabelStyle -> Directive[White, 14, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n    FrameLabel -> {Style[\"[Ligand] (\\[Mu]M)\", 14, White],\n                   Style[\"Fraction folded\", 14, White]},\n    PlotRange -> {{0.8, 1200}, {0, 1}},\n    PlotRangePadding -> Scaled[0.04],\n    ImageSize -> 540, AspectRatio -> 0.75,\n    PlotLegends -> Placed[LineLegend[eCols, {\"E1\",\"E2\",\"E3\"},\n      LabelStyle -> Directive[White,12], Background -> darkBg,\n      LegendFunction -> (Framed[#, Background->darkBg,\n                           FrameStyle->fgStyle]&)], Right]\n  ],\n  (* Model A: dashed gray — no non-folding fraction *)\n  Plot[f0 + (1-f0)/(1 + 10^(Log10[kdA] - Log10[cx])), {cx, 0.8, 1200},\n    ScalingFunctions -> {\"Log10\", None},\n    PlotStyle -> Directive[GrayLevel[0.65], Dashed, AbsoluteThickness[2.]],\n    Axes -> False],\n  (* Model B: solid white — with non-folding fraction *)\n  Plot[f0 + (1-nfBval)*(1-f0)/(1 + 10^(Log10[kdB] - Log10[cx])), {cx, 0.8, 1200},\n    ScalingFunctions -> {\"Log10\", None},\n    PlotStyle -> Directive[White, AbsoluteThickness[2.]],\n    Axes -> False],\n  Epilog -> {\n    (* \"no NF\" label — top right *)\n    Text[Style[Row[{\"no NF:  K\", Subscript[\"D\",\"\"], \" = \",\n      NumberForm[Round[kdA, 1.], {6,1}], \" \\[Mu]M\"}],\n      GrayLevel[0.65], 12, FontFamily->\"Arial\"], Scaled[{0.8, 0.80}]],\n    (* \"NF = ...\" label — middle, just above the plateau *)\n    Text[Style[Row[{\"NF = \", NumberForm[nfBval, {3,2}], \":  K\",\n      Subscript[\"D\",\"\"], \" = \",\n      NumberForm[Round[kdB, 1.], {6,1}], \" \\[Mu]M\"}],\n      White, 12, FontFamily->\"Arial\"], Scaled[{0.42, 0.43}]]\n  }\n]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "57febfe5-56ad-4edd-accc-9ea8388f1f80"
    }
   ],
