  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 6. Export\nExports key figures as PDFs to a `figures/` folder next to `dataDir`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "exportFigure = False; (* set to True to export all figures as PDFs *)\n\nIf[exportFigure,\n  figDir = FileNameJoin[{DirectoryName[dataDir], \"figures\"}];\n  If[!DirectoryQ[figDir], CreateDirectory[figDir]];\n  Print[\"Saving to: \", figDir];\n\n  exportFig[fig_, name_] := (\n    Export[FileNameJoin[{figDir, name <> \".pdf\"}], fig];\n    Print[\"✓ \", name]\n  );\n\n  (* Drift *)\n  exportFig[DCTPlots`PlotGK[goodSpecs],            \"drift_gK\"];\n  exportFig[DCTPlots`PlotTimeSeries[goodSpecs],    \"drift_timeSeries\"];\n  exportFig[DCTPlots`PlotDCTHeatmap[goodSpecs],    \"drift_heatmap\"];\n  exportFig[DCTPlots`PlotKKResiduals[kkRep],       \"drift_kkResiduals\"];\n\n  (* Concentration (skip if not fitted) *)\n  If[ValueQ[concGoodSpecs] && Length[concGoodSpecs] > 0,\n    exportFig[DCTPlots`PlotGK[concGoodSpecs], \"conc_gK\"]\n  ];\n\n  Print[Style[\"Export done.\", Bold, Darker[Green]]],\n\n  Print[Style[\"exportFigure = False — set to True to export.\", Italic, GrayLevel[0.6]]]\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mq69bhex-jojbxi5\" data-page-width-em=\"51\" data-latex-b64=\"XG1hdGhpdHtcdGV4dGNvbG9yeyM5OTk5OTl9e1x0ZXh0e2V4cG9ydEZpZ3VyZSA9IEZhbHNlIC0tLSBzZXQgdG8gVHJ1ZSB0byBleHBvcnQufX19\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\" style=\"color:#999999;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#999999;\">exportFigure = False — set to True to export.</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div></div>",
